      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu enjili kuZikilaŋi kwadiŋi Davidi, hachidiŋiyi kudipatamu mpwembu kuchina mwana kaKishi Sawulu, niwena nawa wowuayilobu akwakumukwasha kunjita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aasilaŋa namata anyikunji, elu kila ŋakwasa malola nanyonji, hela kusowa nyivu nawuta wamukunji hela nachikasa chachidiilu hela nachimunswa; adiŋi akudi ana kwaSawulu waBenjamini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kudi aGadi kwambukili ayilobu akwaŋovu hiyakuya kumpwembu kwadiniyi Davidi mwisaŋa, adiŋi amayala adiza dehi kwasa njita, elukakukwata nkebu nevoŋa, kumesu awu neyi kumesu anyituŋa, akweti lufuchineyi mbaala yakumapidi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezeri diyi mukulumpi, wamuchiyedi Obadiva, wamuchisatu Eliyabi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wamuchiwana Mishimana, wamu chitanu Yeremiya;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kudi anyana kaBenjamini nikudi anyana kaYuda kwafumini amakwawu hiyakwinza kumpwembu kwadiŋiyi Davidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi hakuya nakuyikinkilila, hakuhosha nawu nindi, Neyi munenzi kudami chamwena kulonda munkwashuku, tukwikala namuchima wetu wumu; ilaŋ neyi munenzina kunfukeja kudi akwankunyi nami, ami nabula katama kumakasami, Nzambi yawankakulula jetu ataluku, ayihoshumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Spiritu hakwinzahadi Amasayi, mukulumpi wamakumi asatu, hakwila nindi, Etu tuyantu eyi, eyi Davidi, tunakumi kudeyi, eyi mwana kajesi. Kuwunda, kuwunda kwikali kudeyi, nikudi ankwashi jeyi kwikali kuwunda; muloŋa akukwashaŋa kudi Nzambi yeyi. Davidi hakuyitambula, hakuyilisha awakulumpi achendu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "KwaManase kwawombolokeli nawa amakwawu, hiyakwinza kudi. Davidi hadiŋi nakuyayi hamu nawaFwilistinu nindi akadasi njita naSawulu, hela chochu, hiyayikwashili kwawuku; muloŋa tulamba twawaFwilistinu chatiyaŋenuwu hiyakumwila nawu, Yaŋa kweyi; elili nawu, Wakenzakawo mboloka hakuya kudi mwanta windi Sawulu, hitwakamona yakala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chadiŋi nakuyayi kuZikilaŋi, akwaManase awombolokeli, enjili kudi yena aAdina naYozabadi, niYediyayeli, niMikayeli, niYozabadi, niElihu, niZiletayi, awakulumpi amakombakaji akuManase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakumukwasha Davidi kwasa chendu chawakwakuta mbatamba; muloŋa wejima wawu adiŋi ayilobu akwaŋovu hohu, adiŋi awakulumpi anjita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa hamafuku anakudi Davidi kwenjilaŋa antu hefuku hefuku nakumukwashaku, yila ninjitayeneni, neyi njita yaNzambi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu mwachindililuwu awakulumpi anawa amanyekelelaŋa njita, enjili kuHeberoni kwadiŋi Davidi, kulonda kubalumuna wanta waSawulu wikali wayena, mwomwizu daYehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaYuda asendelaŋa nkebu namayoŋa, ashikili mumakombakaji atanu nadimu namakulakaji atanu nasatu, amanyekela njita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akudi anyana kaSimeyona, ayilobu akwaŋovu jakwasa njita, makombakaji atanu nayedi nankulakaji yimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenawa ejima adiŋi akwanjita, eluka kusala munyisululu, enjili kuHeberoni namuchima walala chikupu, kulonda amudiishi Davidi wantawa waIsarela ejima; niaIsarela ejima asheluku nawa adiŋi namuchima wawuwumu hohu wakumudiisha Davidi wanta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiŋi kwenoku hamuna Davidi mafuku asatu nakudya nakunwa; ana kwawu adiŋi ayiloŋeshela dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niadiŋi kwakwihi nawena nawa akushika nikuIsakari, niku-Zebuluni, nikuNafwatali, hiyakuleta yakudya hayimbulu, nihanŋameli, nihayingo nŋavalu, nihaŋombi, hiyakuleta niwupa wakudya, nimankendi ayikuyu yakudima, ninyikanji yanyikabu yanyivinyu yawuma, nivinyu, nimanji, ni aŋombi, nianyikoku kulumbama; muloŋa kudi aIsarela kwadiŋi kuzaŋalala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
